        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-white leading-tight mb-8">
          Is a <span class="text-[#38BDF8]">Self-Emptying Dock</span> Worth It?
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          A robot bin holds about half a litre. With a pet, that is two runs. The dock is what decides whether you handle the machine twice a week or twice a season.
